= LOD Properties =

#type: node
#context: sop
#internal: a3ob_lod_properties
#tags: arma, p3d

"""Sets the LOD type, resolution, named properties and LOD copies of a LOD geometry."""

Every LOD has a type (for example Visual or Geometry), a resolution number and a list of named properties. This node sets them on the LOD geometry that comes in.

@inputs

LOD geometry:
    The LOD whose type, resolution, properties and copies you want to set.

@parameters

Read from Input:
    #id: fromin

    Copy the type, resolution, properties and copies of the input into the parameters below. Use it right after Extract LOD.

    Type: Button.

Set Type and Resolution:
    #id: settype

    Off: leave the input's type and resolution alone and only edit properties and copies.

    Type: On or off. Default: On.

LOD Type:
    #id: lodtype

    The kind of LOD.

    Type: Menu. Default: Resolution.

    Resolution:
        Visual resolution

    View - Gunner:
        Gunner first person view

    View - Pilot:
        First person view

    View - Cargo:
        Passenger first person view

    Shadow Volume:
        Shadow casting geometry

    Edit:
        Temporary layer

    Geometry:
        Object collision geometry and occluders

    Geometry Buoyancy:
        Buoyant object geometry (Displacement for VBS)

    Geometry PhysX:
        PhysX object collision geometry

    Memory:
        Hard points and animation axes

    Land Contact:
        Points of contact with ground

    Roadway:
        Walkable surfaces

    Paths:
        AI path finding mesh

    Hit-points:
        Hit point cloud

    View Geometry:
        View occlusion for AI

    Fire Geometry:
        Hitbox geometry

    View - Cargo Geometry:
        Passenger view collision geometry and occluders

    View - Cargo Fire Geometry:
        Passenger view hitbox geometry

    View - Commander:
        Commander first person view

    View - Commander Geometry:
        Commander view collision geometry and occluders

    View - Commander Fire Geometry:
        Commander hitbox geometry

    View - Pilot Geometry:
        First person collision geometry and occluders

    View - Pilot Fire Geometry:
        First person hitbox geometry

    View - Gunner Geometry:
        Gunner collision geometry and occluders

    View - Gunner Fire Geometry:
        Gunner view hitbox geometry

    Sub Parts:
        Obsolete

    Shadow Volume - Cargo View:
        Passenger view shadow casting geometry

    Shadow Volume - Pilot View:
        First person view shadow casting geometry

    Shadow Volume - Gunner View:
        Gunner view shadow casting geometry

    Wreckage:
        Vehicle wreckage

    Underground (VBS):
        Underground volume for VBS (not supported in Arma 3 -> Geometry PhysX Old)

    Groundlayer (VBS):
        Ground deformation data for VBS (not supported in Arma 3 -> Shadow Volume 3000)

    Navigation (VBS):
        Navigation data for VBS (not supported in Arma 3 -> Geometry / Resolution 5e+013)

    Unknown:
        Unknown model layer

Resolution:
    #id: resolution

    The resolution or index. Only types that carry one use it. For Unknown it is the signature value.

    Type: Number. Default: 1.

Property Mode:
    #id: propmode

    Add to input: the rows below are added, and a row with the same name (any case) replaces the input's entry. Replace all: only the rows below remain. LOD copies follow the same mode.

    Type: Menu. Default: Add to Input.

    Choices: Add to Input, Replace All.

Properties:
    #id: props

    Named properties of the LOD (at most 63 characters each).

    Type: List of rows. Default: 0 rows.

    Each row has these parameters. The number in the row replaces the # in the name.

    Name #:
        #id: prop_name

        Type: Text. Default: (empty).

    Value #:
        #id: prop_value

        Type: Text. Default: (empty).

LOD Copies:
    #id: copies

    The same mesh written again under another signature (A3OB's Copies).

    Type: List of rows. Default: 0 rows.

    Each row has these parameters. The number in the row replaces the # in the name.

    Copy Type #:
        #id: copy_type

        Type: Menu. Default: Resolution.

        Choices: Resolution, View - Gunner, View - Pilot, View - Cargo, Shadow Volume, Edit, Geometry, Geometry Buoyancy, Geometry PhysX, Memory, Land Contact, Roadway, Paths, Hit-points, View Geometry, Fire Geometry, View - Cargo Geometry, View - Cargo Fire Geometry, View - Commander, View - Commander Geometry, View - Commander Fire Geometry, View - Pilot Geometry, View - Pilot Fire Geometry, View - Gunner Geometry, View - Gunner Fire Geometry, Sub Parts, Shadow Volume - Cargo View, Shadow Volume - Pilot View, Shadow Volume - Gunner View, Wreckage, Underground (VBS), Groundlayer (VBS), Navigation (VBS), Unknown.

    Copy Resolution #:
        #id: copy_res

        Type: Number. Default: 1.

The full page for this node is docs/user/reference/a3ob_lod_properties.html in the A3OB folder. Open it in a web browser.
